# Docker 构建上下文（仓库根目录）忽略清单
# 目标：只把 backend/ 与 frontend/ 的源码送进构建器，避免把本机数据、密钥、
# 构建产物、离线包一起传进去（既慢又可能泄密）。

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 版本库与本地工具
.git
.gitignore
.github
.work
.workbuddy
.acl-recovery
doc
logs
*.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 本机运行数据与密钥
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
backend/.venv
backend/data
backend/uploads
backend/tests
backend/.pytest_cache
backend/**/__pycache__
backend/**/*.pyc
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/.vite
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
data
uploads
certs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Docker 部署目录中的运行时内容
docker/.env
docker/.env.*
docker/Caddyfile
docker/certs
docker/data
docker/images
docker/dist
docker/*.tar
docker/*.tar.gz
docker/pm-docker-offline-*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 打包产物
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tar
pm-windows-portable.zip
pm-linux-portable.tar.gz
pm-offline-*
